WHO?

585
00:30:57,730 --> 00:30:59,691
Juliet. Sinusuot niya ang hitsura ko.

586
00:30:59,774 --> 00:31:01,734
Pareho kayong gumagawa nito.

587
00:31:01,818 --> 00:31:03,319
Ginagawa ko itong mas mahusay.

588
00:31:03,862 --> 00:31:05,280
Alam mo, Perry,

589
00:31:05,780 --> 00:31:09,033
buong gabi mo siyang binabantayan
at saglit lang.

590
00:31:09,117 --> 00:31:10,118
